OL,5,G1100 Traffic Cops
OL,6,     FAn estimated #10 billion worth of
OL,7,     Fillegal drugs are sold in the UK
OL,8,     Fevery year. In this episode, cops
OL,9,     Fcrack down on drug gangs ruling
OL,10,     Fthrough fear and dealers cashing
OL,11,     Fin on victims.
OL,12,G1200 Traffic Cops
OL,13,     FWith Derbyshire bordered by seven
OL,14,     Fcounties, policing its roads for
OL,15,     Fcriminals on the move is hard. In
OL,16,     Fthis edition cops investigate a
OL,17,     Fpossible cloned vehicle and seek a
OL,18,     Fstolen caravan.
