OL,5,G1300 Traffic Cops
OL,6,     FWith reoffending rates on the rise
OL,7,     Fin the UK, we follow the Traffic
OL,8,     FCops as they are increasingly
OL,9,     Ffaced with seasoned criminals,
OL,10,     Fexperienced at evading the law.
OL,11,G1400 Police Interceptors
OL,12,     FChris's tracker dog Ronny has a
OL,13,     Ftwitchy nose but will this canine
OL,14,     Fcrime fighter manage to track down
OL,15,     Fa villain?
OL,16,G1500 Police Interceptors
OL,17,     FThe interceptors make an early
OL,18,     Fhour dash to catch a team of late
OL,19,     Fnight burglars and one of the
OL,20,     Fsuspects treats Liam to a face
OL,21,     Ffull of saliva.
