OL,11,G1700 Rogue Claimers
OL,12,     FA traveller's account of being
OL,13,     Frobbed at gunpoint turns out to be
OL,14,     Fa lie. When a man's cellar floods
OL,15,     Fwith raw sewage the smell of fraud
OL,16,     Fis unmistakable.
