OL,11,     Fnew tattoo suggests infection. Dr
OL,12,     FTim responds quickly to Michael's
OL,13,     Ffast-growing lump in his throat,
OL,14,     Fwhile Fabia tackles troublesome
OL,15,     Fgut bacteria.
